[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14171.67, "timestamp": "03:56:11", "text": "所以我只需要简单地清洗一下鸡蛋就可以了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14174.389, "timestamp": "03:56:14", "text": "把它拿在手里。是的，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14177.269, "timestamp": "03:56:17", "text": "能。你手里拿着什么？什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14179.91, "timestamp": "03:56:19", "text": "你用的是什么符号？我不知道该怎么做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14181.63, "timestamp": "03:56:21", "text": "我知道？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14185.11, "timestamp": "03:56:25", "text": "呃，你洗鸡蛋了吗？不，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14187.51, "timestamp": "03:56:27", "text": "然而。好的，如果你可以的话，你可以洗鸡蛋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14190.389, "timestamp": "03:56:30", "text": "想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14191.83, "timestamp": "03:56:31", "text": "因为你可以洗鸡蛋，而且你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14194.07, "timestamp": "03:56:34", "text": "如果你……就把它拿在手里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14208.55, "timestamp": "03:56:48", "text": "糟糕。好的。这是一个令人毛骨悚然的眼睛符号。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14211.75, "timestamp": "03:56:51", "text": "令人毛骨悚然的眼睛符号。对，是眼睛的符号。"}]